  "id": "alpha-wave",
  "term": "alpha wave",
  "definition": "An alpha wave is a type of brain rhythm measured with EEG and classified as one of the main frequency bands linked to mental states. It is described as the primary human brain oscillation, and changes in its activity are commonly used to track effects in meditation research.",
